#: src/menus/layer/alpha-add.xml:18(secondary)
msgid "Transparency managing"
msgstr "Hantera transparens"

#: src/menus/layer/threshold-alpha.xml:21(para)
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Threshold Alpha…</guimenuitem> command converts semi-"
"transparent areas of the active layer into completely transparent or "
"completely opaque areas, based on a threshold you set."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Tröskelvärde alfa…</guimenuitem> gör "
"halvgenomskinliga områden i det aktiva lagret helt genomskinliga eller helt "
"opaka, utifrån ett tröskelvärde som du anger."

#: src/menus/layer/threshold-alpha.xml:27(para)
msgid ""
"It only works on layers which have an alpha channel. If the <guilabel>Lock "
"alpha channel</guilabel> option is checked in the <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"layer-dialog\">Layers Dialog</link>, the filter will have no effect."
msgstr ""
"Det fungerar bara på lager med en alfakanal. Om alternativet <guilabel>Lås "
"alfakanal</guilabel> är markerat i <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-"
"dialog\">dialogen Lager</link> får filtret ingen effekt."

#: src/menus/layer/threshold-alpha.xml:33(para)
#: src/menus/layer/scale.xml:28(para) src/menus/layer/offset.xml:29(para)
#: src/menus/layer/color-to-alpha.xml:30(para)
#: src/menus/layer/alpha-semi-flatten.xml:32(para)
msgid "This command only works on a single layer."
msgstr "Kommandot fungerar bara på ett lager i taget."

#: src/menus/layer/threshold-alpha.xml:40(para)
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transparency</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Threshold"
" Alpha…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar kommandot i huvudmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transparens</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Tröskelvärde"
" alfa…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

