#: src/menus/layer/threshold-alpha.xml:77(term)
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Värde"

#: src/menus/layer/threshold-alpha.xml:79(para)
msgid ""
"The threshold alpha value determines which values will become transparent or"
" opaque. You can set the transparency value to be used by using the slider "
"or by entering a value between 0 and 1 in the input box. All transparency "
"values above this threshold will become opaque and all transparency values "
"below or equal to this threshold will become completely transparent."
msgstr ""
"Alfatröskelvärdet avgör vilka värden som blir genomskinliga eller opaka. "
"Ställ in värdet med skjutreglaget eller skriv ett värde mellan 0 och 1 i "
"inmatningsfältet. Värden över tröskeln blir opaka, medan värden som är lika "
"med eller lägre blir helt genomskinliga."

#: src/menus/layer/threshold-alpha.xml:89(para)
msgid ""
"This command will never make completely transparent pixels (alpha value = 0)"
" opaque."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot gör aldrig helt genomskinliga bildpunkter (alfavärde = 0) opaka."

#: src/menus/layer/threshold-alpha.xml:95(title)
msgid "Threshold Alpha example"
msgstr "Exempel på alfatröskel"

#: src/menus/layer/threshold-alpha.xml:101(caption)
msgid "A transparency gradient 0-255."
msgstr "En transparensövertoning 0–255."

#: src/menus/layer/threshold-alpha.xml:110(caption)
msgid "Threshold set to 50, 127, 210."
msgstr "Tröskelvärdena är 50, 127 och 210."

#: src/menus/layer/text-to-path.xml:5(title)
msgid "Text to Path"
msgstr "Text till bana"

#: src/menus/layer/text-to-path.xml:9(secondary)
#: src/menus/layer/text-to-path.xml:13(primary)
#: src/menus/layer/text-discard.xml:21(primary)
#: src/menus/layer/text-along-path.xml:9(secondary)
#: src/menus/layer/text-along-path.xml:13(primary)
msgid "Text"
msgstr "Text"

#: src/menus/layer/text-to-path.xml:10(tertiary)
#: src/menus/layer/text-to-path.xml:14(secondary)
msgid "to Path"
msgstr "till bana"

#: src/menus/layer/text-to-path.xml:17(para)
msgid ""
"This command creates a path from the outline of each selected text layer. "
"Each path can be managed through the <link linkend=\"gimp-path-"
"dialog\">Paths Dialog</link>. For more information see also <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-text-tool-text-to-path\">Text to Path</link> in Text "
"Management."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot skapar en bana längs konturen på varje markerat textlager. Banorna"
" kan hanteras i <link linkend=\"gimp-path-dialog\">dialogen Banor</link>. "
"Mer information finns i <link linkend=\"gimp-text-tool-text-to-path\">Text "
"till bana</link> under Textbehandling."

#: src/menus/layer/text-to-path.xml:26(para)
msgid ""
"This command only appears in the <guimenuitem>Layer</guimenuitem> menu if at"
" least one text layer is selected."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot visas i menyn <guimenuitem>Lager</guimenuitem> bara när minst ett "
"textlager är markerat."

#: src/menus/layer/text-to-path.xml:36(para)
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Text to "
"Path</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar kommandot i huvudmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Text till "
"bana</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/layer/text-to-path.xml:45(para)
msgid ""
"From the <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-dialog\">Layers Dialog</link>, you can "
"access it through the <guimenuitem>Text to Path</guimenuitem> command of its"
" context menu."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också öppna kommandot <guimenuitem>Text till bana</guimenuitem> i "
"snabbmenyn i <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-dialog\">dialogen Lager</link>."

#: src/menus/layer/text-discard.xml:10(title)
msgid "Rasterize, Revert Rasterize"
msgstr "Rastrera, återställ rastrering"

#: src/menus/layer/text-discard.xml:14(secondary)
msgid "Rasterize"
msgstr "Rastrera"

#: src/menus/layer/text-discard.xml:18(secondary)
msgid "Revert Rasterize"
msgstr "Återställ rastrering"

#: src/menus/layer/text-discard.xml:22(secondary)
#: src/menus/layer/text-discard.xml:26(secondary)
msgid "Discard information"
msgstr "Förkasta information"

#: src/menus/layer/text-discard.xml:25(primary)
msgid "Vector"
msgstr "Vektor"

#: src/menus/layer/text-discard.xml:29(para)
msgid ""
"When you add text, vector or link layers to an image, "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> stores specific information for that <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-layer-types\">layer type</link>. This command lets you "
"discard this information, transforming the selected layers into normal "
"bitmap layers."
msgstr ""
"När du lägger till text-, vektor- eller länkade lager i en bild lagrar "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> särskild information om <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-"
"types\">lagertypen</link>. Kommandot tar bort informationen och omvandlar de"
" markerade lagren till vanliga rasterlager."

#: src/menus/layer/text-discard.xml:36(para)
msgid ""
"Note that if you try to perform a graphic operation like painting to one of "
"these special layer types, it will blink and show a warning that you need to"
" rasterize the layer first. By undoing or using <guilabel>Revert "
"Rasterize</guilabel> you can revert the layer back to the layer type it was "
"before rasterizing."
msgstr ""
"Om du försöker måla på någon av de här speciallagren blinkar lagret och "
"visar en varning om att du först måste rastrera det. Ångra åtgärden eller "
"välj <guilabel>Återställ rastrering</guilabel> för att återställa lagrets "
"tidigare typ."

#: src/menus/layer/text-discard.xml:45(para)
msgid ""
"This command only appears in the <guimenuitem>Layer</guimenuitem> menu if at"
" least one relevant layer is selected."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot visas i menyn <guimenuitem>Lager</guimenuitem> bara när minst ett "
"relevant lager är markerat."

#: src/menus/layer/text-discard.xml:55(para)
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Rasterize</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
" If the layer has been rasterized previously, the command will be named "
"<guilabel>Revert Rasterize</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar kommandot i huvudmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Rastrera</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
" Om lagret redan har rastrerats heter kommandot <guilabel>Återställ "
"rastrering</guilabel>."

#: src/menus/layer/text-discard.xml:65(para)
msgid ""
"From the <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-dialog\">Layers Dialog</link>, you can "
"access it through the <guimenuitem>Rasterize</guimenuitem> command of its "
"context menu."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar kommandot i snabbmenyn i <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-"
"dialog\">dialogen Lager</link> under <guimenuitem>Rastrera</guimenuitem>."

#: src/menus/layer/text-commands.xml:9(title)
msgid "The Text Commands of the Layer Menu"
msgstr "Textkommandona i menyn Lager"

#: src/menus/layer/text-commands.xml:11(para)
msgid ""
"The commands <guimenuitem>Text to Path</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Text "
"along Path</guimenuitem>, and <guimenuitem>Rasterize</guimenuitem> only "
"appear in the <guimenuitem>Layer</guimenuitem> menu when a text layer is "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"Kommandona <guimenuitem>Text till bana</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Text "
"längs bana</guimenuitem> och <guimenuitem>Rastrering</guimenuitem> visas "
"bara i <guimenuitem>Lager</guimenuitem>-menyn när ett textlager är markerat."

#: src/menus/layer/text-commands.xml:19(title)
msgid "The Text Commands"
msgstr "Textkommandon"

#: src/menus/layer/text-along-path.xml:5(title)
msgid "Text along Path"
msgstr "Text längs bana"

#: src/menus/layer/text-along-path.xml:10(tertiary)
#: src/menus/layer/text-along-path.xml:14(secondary)
msgid "along Path"
msgstr "längs bana"

#: src/menus/layer/text-along-path.xml:17(para)
msgid ""
"This command wraps the text in the selected text layer along the currently "
"active path. The active path can be changed through the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-path-dialog\">Paths Dialog</link>. For more information see "
"also <link linkend=\"gimp-text-tool-text-along-path\">Text along Path</link>"
" in Text Management."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot lägger texten i det markerade textlagret längs den aktiva banan. "
"Du kan byta aktiv bana i <link linkend=\"gimp-path-dialog\">dialogen "
"Banor</link>. Mer information finns i <link linkend=\"gimp-text-tool-text-"
"along-path\">Text längs bana</link> under Textbehandling."

#: src/menus/layer/text-along-path.xml:27(para)
msgid ""
"This command only appears in the <guimenuitem>Layer</guimenuitem> menu if "
"one text layer is selected. At least one path needs to be available, or this"
" command will have no effect."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot visas i menyn <guimenuitem>Lager</guimenuitem> bara när ett "
"textlager är markerat. Det krävs också minst en bana; annars händer inget."

#: src/menus/layer/text-along-path.xml:38(para)
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Text along "
"Path</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar kommandot i huvudmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Text längs "
"bana</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/layer/text-along-path.xml:47(para)
msgid ""
"From the <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-dialog\">Layers Dialog</link>, you can "
"access it through the <guimenuitem>Text along Path</guimenuitem> command of "
"its context menu."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också öppna kommandot <guimenuitem>Text längs bana</guimenuitem> i "
"snabbmenyn i <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-dialog\">dialogen Lager</link>."

#: src/menus/layer/stack.xml:12(title)
msgid "<quote>Stack</quote> Submenu"
msgstr "Undermenyn <quote>Stapel</quote>"

#: src/menus/layer/stack.xml:17(tertiary)
#: src/menus/layer/stack.xml:20(primary)
msgid "Stack"
msgstr "Stapel"

#: src/menus/layer/stack.xml:23(para)
msgid ""
"The layer stack is simply the list of layers in the Layers dialog. The "
"<guimenu>Stack</guimenu> submenu contains operations which either allow you "
"to change which layers are selected, or change the position of the selected "
"layers in the layer stack. If your image has only one layer, these commands "
"are disabled."
msgstr ""
"Lagerstapeln är listan över lager i dialogen Lager. I undermenyn "
"<guimenu>Stapel</guimenu> finns kommandon för att ändra vilka lager som är "
"markerade och för att flytta markerade lager i stapeln. Kommandona är "
"inaktiverade om bilden bara har ett lager."

#: src/menus/layer/stack.xml:33(para)
msgid ""
"You can access this submenu from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Stack</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar undermenyn i huvudmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Stapel</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/layer/stack.xml:43(title)
msgid "The Contents of the <quote>Stack</quote> Submenu"
msgstr "Innehållet i undermenyn <quote>Stapel</quote>"

#: src/menus/layer/stack.xml:44(para)
msgid ""
"The <guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu> submenu contains the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Undermenyn <guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu> innehåller följande kommandon:"

#: src/menus/layer/stack-reverse.xml:10(title)
msgid "Reverse Layer Order"
msgstr "Omvänd lagerordning"

#: src/menus/layer/stack-reverse.xml:15(tertiary)
msgid "Reverse layer order"
msgstr "Omvänd lagerordning"

#: src/menus/layer/stack-reverse.xml:18(para)
msgid ""
"This command reverses the order of the layers. That is, the top layer "
"becomes the bottom layer, and so on until the bottom layer becomes the top "
"layer."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot vänder på lagerordningen: det översta lagret hamnar underst, det "
"näst översta näst underst och så vidare."

#: src/menus/layer/stack-reverse.xml:25(para)
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layers</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Reverse"
" Layer Order</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar kommandot i huvudmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stapel</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Omvänd"
" lagerordning</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

