msgstr "Ursprunglig bild med en markering."

#: src/menus/layer/mask-selection-subtract.xml:69(para)
#: src/menus/layer/mask-selection-replace.xml:81(para)
#: src/menus/layer/mask-selection-intersect.xml:74(para)
#: src/menus/layer/mask-selection-add.xml:73(para)
msgid ""
"The <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-dialog\">Layers Dialog</link> with a layer "
"mask created via <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-mask-add\">Add Layer "
"Masks…</link> with the <quote>Layer's alpha channel</quote> option enabled."
msgstr ""
"Dialogen <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-dialog\">Lager</link> med en lagermask "
"som skapats via <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-mask-add\">Lägg till "
"lagermasker…</link>, med alternativet <quote>Lagrets alfakanal</quote> "
"aktiverat."

#: src/menus/layer/mask-selection-subtract.xml:83(para)
msgid ""
"The result after applying <quote>Subtract Masks from Selection</quote>: the "
"selection of the non-transparent pixels of the active layer is subtracted "
"from the initial selection."
msgstr ""
"Resultatet efter <quote>Ta bort masker från markering</quote>: markeringen "
"av det aktiva lagrets synliga bildpunkter har dragits bort från den "
"ursprungliga markeringen."

