"The result after applying <quote>Masks to Selection</quote>: the selection "
"of the non-transparent pixels of the selected layer replaces the initial "
"selection."
msgstr ""
"Resultatet efter <quote>Masker till markering</quote>: markeringen av det "
"markerade lagrets synliga bildpunkter ersätter den ursprungliga markeringen."

