msgid "Flip Horizontally"
msgstr "Vänd vågrätt"

#: src/menus/layer/flip-horizontal.xml:16(tertiary)
msgid "Flip horizontally"
msgstr "Vänd vågrätt"

#: src/menus/layer/flip-horizontal.xml:19(primary)
msgid "Flip horizontally (layer)"
msgstr "Vänd vågrätt (lager)"

#: src/menus/layer/flip-horizontal.xml:22(para)
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Flip Horizontally</guimenuitem> command reverses the "
"selected layers horizontally, that is, from left to right."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Vänd horisontellt</guimenuitem> spegelvänder de "
"markerade lagren från vänster till höger."

#: src/menus/layer/flip-horizontal.xml:32(para)
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transform</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Flip"
" Horizontally</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar kommandot i huvudmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transformera</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Vänd"
" horisontellt</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/layer/flip-horizontal.xml:45(title)
msgid "Applying <quote>Flip Layer Horizontally</quote>"
msgstr "Tillämpa <quote>Vänd lager vågrätt</quote>"

#: src/menus/layer/flip-horizontal.xml:61(para)
msgid ""
"The layer after it has been flipped. It looks as if the image has been "
"reflected along the central <emphasis>vertical</emphasis> axis of the layer."
msgstr ""
"Lagret efter att det har vänts. Det ser ut som om bilden har speglats längs "
"lagrets centrala <emphasis>lodräta</emphasis> axel."

