#: src/menus/layer/duplicate.xml:13(title)
msgid "Duplicate layers"
msgstr "Duplicera lager"

#: src/menus/layer/duplicate.xml:18(tertiary)
msgid "Layer duplicate"
msgstr "Lagerdubblett"

#: src/menus/layer/duplicate.xml:21(primary)
msgid "Duplicate Layers"
msgstr "Duplicera lager"

#: src/menus/layer/duplicate.xml:24(para)
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Duplicate Layers</guimenuitem> command adds a copy of each "
"selected layer to the image. The name of each new layer is the same as the "
"name of the original layer, but with <quote>copy</quote> or a number "
"appended to it."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Duplicera lager</guimenuitem> lägger till en kopia av"
" varje markerat lager i bilden. Kopian får samma namn som originallagret med"
" tillägget <quote>kopia</quote> eller ett nummer."

#: src/menus/layer/duplicate.xml:30(para)
msgid ""
"Note that if there are any <link linkend=\"glossary-"
"parasite\">parasites</link> attached to the selected layers, they are not "
"duplicated."
msgstr ""
"Eventuella <link linkend=\"glossary-parasite\">parasiter</link> som är "
"kopplade till de markerade lagren kopieras inte."

#: src/menus/layer/duplicate.xml:39(para)
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Duplicate "
"Layers</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar kommandot i huvudmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Duplicera "
"lager</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/layer/duplicate.xml:48(para)
msgid ""
"You can also use the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>D</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också använda snabbtangenten "
"<keycombo><keycap>Skift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>D</keycap></keycombo>."

#: src/menus/layer/duplicate.xml:58(para)
msgid ""
"From the <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-dialog\">Layers Dialog</link>, you can "
"access it through the <guimenuitem>Duplicate Layers</guimenuitem> command of"
" its context menu, or by clicking on the <placeholder-1/> icon button on the"
" bottom of that dialog."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också öppna <guimenuitem>Duplicera lager</guimenuitem> i snabbmenyn i"
" <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-dialog\">dialogen Lager</link> eller klicka på "
"knappen med ikonen <placeholder-1/> längst ned i dialogrutan."

