#: src/menus/layer/delete.xml:18(tertiary)
msgid "Delete selected layers"
msgstr "Ta bort markerade lager"

#: src/menus/layer/delete.xml:21(para)
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Delete Layers</guimenuitem> command deletes the selected "
"layers from the image."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Ta bort lager</guimenuitem> tar bort de markerade "
"lagren från bilden."

#: src/menus/layer/delete.xml:30(para)
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Delete "
"Layers</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar kommandot i huvudmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Ta bort "
"lager</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/layer/delete.xml:39(para)
msgid ""
"From the <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-dialog\">Layers Dialog</link>, you can "
"access it through the <guimenuitem>Delete Layers</guimenuitem> command of "
"its context menu, by clicking on the <placeholder-1/> icon button on the "
"bottom of that dialog, or by dragging and dropping the selected layers on "
"top of that button."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också ta bort lagren med kommandot <guimenuitem>Ta bort "
"lager</guimenuitem> i snabbmenyn i <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-"
"dialog\">dialogen Lager</link>, klicka på knappen med ikonen "
"<placeholder-1/> längst ned eller dra de markerade lagren till knappen."

