#: src/menus/layer/anchor.xml:8(title) src/menus/layer/anchor.xml:15(primary)
msgid "Anchor Floating Layer or Mask"
msgstr "Förankra flytande lager eller mask"

#: src/menus/layer/anchor.xml:12(secondary)
msgid "Anchor the floating layer or mask"
msgstr "Förankra det flytande lagret eller masken"

#: src/menus/layer/anchor.xml:18(para)
msgid ""
"If you have created a floating selection, a temporary layer, called a "
"<quote>floating layer</quote> or <quote>floating selection</quote>, is added"
" to the layer stack. As long as the floating layer persists, you can only "
"work on that layer."
msgstr ""
"När du skapar en flytande markering läggs ett tillfälligt lager till i "
"lagerstapeln. Det kallas <quote>flytande lager</quote> eller <quote>flytande"
" markering</quote>. Så länge det finns kvar kan du bara arbeta med det "
"lagret."

#: src/menus/layer/anchor.xml:24(para)
msgid ""
"To work on the rest of the image, you must <quote>anchor</quote> the "
"floating layer to the former active layer with the <guimenuitem>Anchor "
"Floating Layer or Mask</guimenuitem> command; or convert it to a new layer "
"with the <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-new\">To New Layer</link> command. The "
"anchor menu command is only visible if a floating selection is present."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill arbeta med resten av bilden måste du <quote>förankra</quote> det "
"flytande lagret i det tidigare aktiva lagret med kommandot "
"<guimenuitem>Förankra flytande lager eller mask</guimenuitem>, eller "
"omvandla det till ett nytt lager med kommandot <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-"
"new\">Till nytt lager</link>. Förankringskommandot visas bara när det finns "
"en flytande markering."

#: src/menus/layer/anchor.xml:33(para)
msgid ""
"If there is an active selection tool, the mouse pointer is displayed with an"
" anchor icon when it is outside of the selection."
msgstr ""
"Om ett markeringsverktyg är aktivt visas muspekaren med en ankarikon när den"
" befinner sig utanför markeringen."

#: src/menus/layer/anchor.xml:43(para)
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Anchor Floating Layer or "
"Mask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar kommandot i huvudmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guimenuitem>Förankra flytande lager "
"eller mask</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/layer/anchor.xml:52(para)
msgid ""
"You can also use the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>H</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också använda snabbtangenten "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>H</keycap></keycombo>."

#: src/menus/layer/anchor.xml:61(para)
msgid ""
"From the <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-dialog\">Layers Dialog</link>, you can "
"access it through the <guimenuitem>Anchor Floating Layer or "
"Mask</guimenuitem> command of its context menu, or by clicking on the "
"<placeholder-1/> icon button on the bottom of that dialog."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också öppna <guimenuitem>Förankra flytande lager eller "
"mask</guimenuitem> i snabbmenyn i <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-"
"dialog\">dialogen Lager</link> eller klicka på knappen med ikonen "
"<placeholder-1/> längst ned i dialogrutan."

#: src/menus/layer/anchor.xml:84(title)
msgid "Alternative Ways of Anchoring a Floating Selection"
msgstr "Alternativa sätt att förankra en flytande markering"

#: src/menus/layer/anchor.xml:85(para)
msgid "Please refer to <xref linkend=\"anchor-floating-selection\"/>"
msgstr "Se <xref linkend=\"anchor-floating-selection\"/>"

#: src/menus/layer/alpha-semi-flatten.xml:13(title)
msgid "Semi-Flatten"
msgstr "Semiutplatta"

#: src/menus/layer/alpha-semi-flatten.xml:18(tertiary)
#: src/menus/layer/alpha-semi-flatten.xml:22(secondary)
msgid "Preserve anti-aliasing"
msgstr "Bevara kantutjämning"

#: src/menus/layer/alpha-semi-flatten.xml:21(primary)
msgid "Anti-aliasing"
msgstr "Kantutjämning"

#: src/menus/layer/alpha-semi-flatten.xml:25(para)
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Semi-Flatten…</guimenuitem> command is described in the "
"<link linkend=\"gimp-filter-semi-flatten\">Semi-Flatten</link> filter "
"chapter. The command is useful when you need an anti-aliased image with "
"indexed colors and transparency."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Semiutplatta…</guimenuitem> beskrivs i kapitlet om "
"filtret <link linkend=\"gimp-filter-semi-flatten\">Semiutplatta</link>. Det "
"är användbart när du behöver en kantutjämnad bild med indexerade färger och "
"genomskinlighet."

#: src/menus/layer/alpha-semi-flatten.xml:41(para)
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transparency</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Semi-"
"Flatten…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar kommandot i huvudmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Transparens</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Semiutplatta…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/layer/alpha-semi-flatten.xml:51(para)
msgid ""
"You can also access it from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Web</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Semi-"
"Flatten…</guimenuitem></menuchoice> (see <xref linkend=\"gimp-filter-semi-"
"flatten\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar också kommandot i huvudmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Webb</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Semiutplatta…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
" (se <xref linkend=\"gimp-filter-semi-flatten\"/>)."

